  "details": "\"Safety System\" Help & Info needs a full rewrite to be accurate.\n\n1. Open Main Menu.\n\n2. Click the \"?\" icon top right for Help & Info.\n\n3. Navigate to Safety group on the left.\n\n4. Click \"Safety System\". Read this article carefully, you'll find outdated text and photos.\n\n5. Compare to the current design of the Launch Pad in Quick Menu, you won't find a \"Safety tab on the top row\" (text).\n\n6. Compare Shield Settings to the current UI design, it's vastly different from the pre-2025 shown in the article.",
